cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "OrbitOS: a hobby AArch64 kernel for the Raspberry Pi 5"
abstract: "A from-scratch AArch64 kernel (boot, MMU, GICv2, generic timer, preemptive scheduler, EL0 tasks, UART shell and chainloader) for the Raspberry Pi 5 and QEMU virt, intended as the base for a phone and smartwatch OS."
authors:
  - name: "the orbit-os authors"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/coopersimpson101-debug/orbit-os"
keywords:
  - operating-system
  - kernel
  - aarch64
  - raspberry-pi-5
  - bare-metal
  - qemu
